   261	// was drafted by an anonymous worker holding the director's tools. The standing layer is
   262	// the ONE definition the answer lanes already share (prompt-core.ts, the door
   263	// dxb-hamza-context: identity line, the persona WHOLE, the CEO language law, honesty, the
